<title>UK: GOLF-WORLD MATCHPLAY SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>GOLF-WORLD MATCHPLAY SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>WENTWORTH, England 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the 36-hole</p>
<p>second round matches in the World Matchplay championship on the</p>
<p>West Course at Wentworth on Friday (prefix number denotes seed):</p>
<p>Vijay Singh (Fiji) beat 3-Steve Jones (U.S.) 9 and 8.</p>
<p>2-Tom Lehman (U.S.) beat 7-Mark O'Meara (U.S.) 6 and 5.</p>
<p>1-Ernie Els (South Africa) beat Steve Stricker (U.S.) by one</p>
<p>hole.</p>
<p>4-Mark Brooks (U.S.) beat 5-Colin Montgomerie (Britain) by one</p>
<p>hole.</p>
</text>
